{"id":"fc0b9805bbc9e410","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-set11-selector-for-partition.md","title":"ZFC Set11 Selector For Partition","display":"df-zfc-set11-selector-for-partition — ZFC Set11 Selector For Partition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set11-selector-for-partition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set11-selector-for-partition"],"display":"df-zfc-set11-selector-for-partition — ZFC Set11 Selector For Partition","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-choice-function]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set11-selector-for-partition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set11-selector-for-partition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set11-selector-for-partition — ZFC Set11 Selector For Partition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"332bc4fce3564b85\" href=\"?note=332bc4fce3564b85\" title=\"58-df-choice-function\">58-df-choice-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\mathcal P\\in V\">\\(S,\\mathcal P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"332bc4fce3564b85\" href=\"?note=332bc4fce3564b85\" title=\"58-df-choice-function\">58-df-choice-function</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11SelectorForPartition}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet11SelectorForPartition}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}selector\\text{-}for\\text{-}partition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11SelectorForPartition}_S(S,\\mathcal P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall P,Q\\in\\mathcal P\\;\\bigl(P\\neq Q\\to P\\cap Q=\\varnothing\\bigr)\n\\land\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S(f,\\mathcal P)\n\\land S=\\operatorname{ran}(f)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}selector\\text{-}for\\text{-}partition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11SelectorForPartition}_S(S,\\mathcal P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall P,Q\\in\\mathcal P\\;\\bigl(P\\neq Q\\to P\\cap Q=\\varnothing\\bigr)\n\\land\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S(f,\\mathcal P)\n\\land S=\\operatorname{ran}(f)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The choice-function witness guarantees that every block is nonempty and contributes one selected element.  Pairwise disjointness makes those values distinct, so the range meets each block exactly once without relying on an undeclared cardinality notation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|S\\cap P|=1\">\\(|S\\cap P|=1\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-choice-function","status":"resolved","id":"332bc4fce3564b85","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-choice-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-choice-function","status":"resolved","id":"332bc4fce3564b85","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-choice-function]]) and $\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-choice-function]]) and $\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,\\mathcal P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11SelectorForPartition}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}selector\\text{-}for\\text{-}partition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11SelectorForPartition}_S(S,\\mathcal P)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall P,Q\\in\\mathcal P\\;\\bigl(P\\neq Q\\to P\\cap Q=\\varnothing\\bigr)\n\\land\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S(f,\\mathcal P)\n\\land S=\\operatorname{ran}(f)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"|S\\cap P|=1","display":false}],"bytes":1350,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3416","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-set11-selector-for-partition.md|58-df-zfc-set11-selector-for-partition]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","332bc4fce3564b85","36d7463d215be751"]}